The board carries 31 FRU EEPROMs: three on the management module
itself, one per fan controller board, and the rest on the compute and
switch boards reached through the I2C muxes.

Populate them from a sanitized dump read from hardware, so guest
firmware can identify the chassis inventory instead of finding blank
parts.

